{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[00:12.00] Got a new .9 that'll leave your mouth wide\n[00:14.90] Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire\n[00:17.70] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[00:20.66] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try\n[00:23.64] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[00:26.54] Get your own business and get out mine\n[00:29.44] Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time\n[00:32.36] Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides\n[00:35.24] Boy, your gang ain't your gang and your homies, not your homies\n[00:38.20] Run it up, get that sack, but do that shit right by your lonely\n[00:41.06] Choppa hit him with a force like I'm Obi-Wan Kenobi\n[00:43.86] Don't need no court to use my torch, I've been shootin' like I'm Kobe\n[00:46.82] I don't need nobody, I just need your body, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[00:49.84] I'm gon' catch a body if you fuck with my money, ayy-ayy-ayy\n[00:52.70] Mixin' them narcotics, turned me to a zombie\n[00:55.04] Ape with a nigga, Harambe, ull up on a nigga, no talkin'\n[00:57.12] Leave a nigga leakin', no faucet, yeah\n[00:58.44] Stand up to the opps, never back down\n[00:59.74] He'll get beat with the belt like it's SmackDown\n[01:01.40] Studio, juug life, trap house, crack cocaine my track outs\n[01:04.40] Up late night like owls, Backwoods, smokin' on White Owls\n[01:07.34] I got the lean on me right now, got a gun with a beam on me right now\n[01:10.20] Got a new .9 that'll leave your mouth wide\n[01:13.08] Leave you hogtied, burnin' on a campfire\n[01:15.88] Before I leave the crib, I pray to God I won't die\n[01:18.84] I know it's hard to kill me, but I know they gon' try\n[01:21.84] You's a pussy boy, yeah, you a feline\n[01:24.72] Get your own business and get out mine\n[01:27.62] Had to kill a witness, ain't doin' no time\n[01:30.52] Watch them niggas around you, they playin' both sides\n[02:08.40] Had to cut some niggas off, started seein' signs\n[02:12.80] Switchin' sides,